# Accessibility

- Icon-only buttons require `aria-label`. Decorative SVGs get `aria-hidden`.
- Modals: `role="dialog"`, `aria-modal="true"`, focus trap, restore on close.
- Lightbox supports Escape, ←, →. Tab cycles inside the dialog only.
- Never remove outlines without `focus-visible:outline` replacement (2px #222).

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<div onClick={open} className="outline-none">📷</div>

// ✅ GOOD
<button type="button" aria-label="Show all photos" onClick={open} className="focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-hof">
```
